<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-13T23:45:23.693Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:45:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican army forces are engaged in street shootouts as they pursue cartel members in Jalisco and other states, and a police helicopter opened fire on a cartel chase near the U.S. border, killing a 7‑year-old American girl. In the United States, an ICE officer in Maine who expressed hatred of immigrants fatally shot an immigrant. The brother of a slain Mexican cartel leader has been sentenced to 22 years in a U.S. prison for a drug-trafficking plot. These incidents add a helicopter-borne civilian casualty and a U.S. law-enforcement shooting to the ongoing cartel violence, which recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOYjRIMVB2OWgzY2tqM1EzcUk1aEZPRW0wd3FqbGRJLXowNktDUUVGLXgyb01ZbUNCd1R0RGxtY1hVVHR0alFvTE9oN3VqcHBDTlE5bndHMThRSHFQRU9LU2JqS1h3ZDl3dFdqbG1kNlZlSGFxODM1QzZBRzNtdENTY29pZWlPQlRTaE5lSVZLV2JBTVRxNlpIMm05VGdGSEQ1ODN2UlJ6emRnVHlaZkdBektHYU14ejNFMnRjRmdR?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPSDJMU3FZUEdVZEgyazB0MU9pbndQZDVHS0RBUG5sUE5lRk53SVVhM3lzREFodG9KS2oyZVcxWHZFdHU0UmVHWGxFM0tOS3pIUEU3S2laXzdRMjhPLWJKYzZLUjZCUDVQNG5YRHl1YUVMWkJjOUY2OGhuVlFrbk55UER6RGxjcjFSRGpN?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQOHg4SG1YVGVmd216dVkydUxNRERxZjZTOHdORS16MldQUzBrXzl0Z3RmZ0VJeVplWFBZdlZUbExVSHBlSGt3VUtmUll4TzZoaGhRY3p6RzJocXVZVU1iSzk2R2VaY3NoUzBPQTVsTGtjemRLUFcwbmQ1S1hlRWlVMHNhQmtSaDAwQXlETjZrNmFLWVJjUHJXN202cDU3ZE5ZS0ww?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNWEJRSXdIVTJlZU9USzVzU3pKZGg0VU1peXdDc1hIWHBnMzROSzRvS3hYUVdHcl9jNFBvV0ZSSDQzQlEzZkZyNkxoWnIyZnYwOHgtQWhVVVhJWU9rRFFEWUcxZnRZNUU4ZHR5aXM0SjFYSUxrLTFsN3FXU0JGe